Chili cheese fry?

161
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:29,960
Yes. I love chili cheese fries.

162
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,530
Really? You love them?

163
00:09:31,530 --> 00:09:32,520
Yeah, why?

164
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:37,830
No reason. I'm just glad to hear you're comfortable saying you love something.

165
00:09:38,430 --> 00:09:40,930
