198
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:25,710
Yeah, I'm sorry about that.

199
00:11:25,710 --> 00:11:28,360
I'm not too proud to admit that I cried myself to sleep.

200
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:31,140
Again, I'm sorry.

201
00:11:31,140 --> 00:11:32,560
And let me tell you, sleep did not

202
