212
00:11:59,270 --> 00:12:01,060
I'm the captain. I can do that.

213
00:12:01,070 --> 00:12:03,690
No, no, that's okay.

214
00:12:03,700 --> 00:12:06,260
Just let me talk to him, and I'll get back to you.

215
00:12:06,270 --> 00:12:08,990
When are you going to talk to him?

216
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:11,290
I don't know.

217
00:12:11,300 --> 00:12:13,590
He's in the laundry room now. Now would be a good time.

218
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:16,790
You're n gonna leave me alone until I do it, are you?

219
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:20,440
Oh, I think we both know the answer to that question.

220
00:12:25,500 --> 00:12:27,290
