229
00:12:46,230 --> 00:12:49,190
And maybe I'm a little ahead of you. That's fine.

230
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:51,990
In fact, it makes sense, 'cause let's face it,

231
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:55,270
