238
00:13:09,930 --> 00:13:11,890
You know what I'm talking about, though.

239
00:13:11,900 --> 00:13:12,860
Yeah, I do.

240
00:13:12,870 --> 00:13:15,290
So, we're good?

241
00:13:15,300 --> 00:13:17,890
Yes, that's what I'm telling you.

242
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:20,120
We are good. We are great.

243
00:13:20,130 --> 00:13:22,220
All right! Fence mended, problem swept under the rug.

244
00:13:22,230 --> 00:13:24,670
Time to bowl!

245
00:13:26,030 --> 00:13:27,160
Yes, I was eavesdropping.

246
00:13:27,170 --> 00:13:29,300
