249
00:13:39,370 --> 00:13:40,520
"The Wesley Crushers"?

250
00:13:40,530 --> 00:13:41,920
No, not The Wesley Crushers.

251
00:13:41,930 --> 00:13:44,160
The Wesley Crushers.

252
00:13:44,170 --> 00:13:45,290
I don't get it.

253
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:46,520
Wesley Crusher was

254
00:13:46,530 --> 00:13:49,390
Wil Wheaton's character on Star Trek.

255
00:13:49,400 --> 00:13:50,620
